    "contract": "Base Algorithm1; x step uses old tracker and OLD compressed model estimates; fresh gradient evaluated at next x; EMA momentum difference and OLD compressed tracker correction update v; compress model/tracker residuals and persist both weighted memories.",
    "initialization": "H0=G0=weighted memories0; V0=M0=one charged local minibatch gradient. Matches synthetic solver consistent initialization, with minibatch instead of full gradient.",
    "reference_differences": [
      "Main optimizer init has V0=gradient and M0=0; we preserve V0=M0 as required by the paper tracking invariant.",
      "Main top helper partitions signed values; we use magnitude-Top-k from the paper and actual synthetic helper.",
      "Cold estimates differ from appendix warm initialization for its simplified initial Lyapunov bound. No free neighbor state/initial full-gradient oracle."
    ],
    "scope": "One fresh gradient per iteration plus charged bootstrap, shared momentum0, fixed symmetric ring/complete/connected regular graphs, stable membership, fully trainable common-dtype parameters, local buffers. Fused two-channel send after gradient; no transfer/compute overlap, MoTEF-VR, local-SGD blocks, loss/recovery, churn or LoRA."
